stream
BT /F1 11 Tf 14 TL 72 760 Td
(Nordvik WM-720 Washing Machine - User Manual) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Safety) Tj T*
(Read this manual before using the appliance. Keep children away from the appliance while) Tj T*
(it is running. Disconnect the power before cleaning or maintenance. Do not use the) Tj T*
(appliance if the power cable is damaged; it must be replaced by Nordvik service.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Installation) Tj T*
(Remove the four transport bolts from the back before first use and keep them for moving.) Tj T*
(Level the machine with the adjustable feet; it must not rock.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Everyday use) Tj T*
(Sort laundry by colour and fabric. The 40-60 programme washes mixed cotton at the stated) Tj T*
(temperature with the lowest energy use. Do not load more than 9 kg of dry laundry. Wool) Tj T*
(should be washed on the Wool programme at 30 degrees and 800 rpm.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Care and maintenance) Tj T*
(Clean the drain pump filter behind the small hatch at the bottom right every two months;) Tj T*
(a cloth on the floor catches the water. Run an empty 90 degree wash once a month to keep) Tj T*
(the drum fresh.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
