6 0 obj
<< /Length 859 >>
stream
BT /F1 11 Tf 14 TL 72 760 Td
(Warranty) Tj T*
(The warranty period is 24 months from the date of purchase for all parts, and 10 years) Tj T*
(for the inverter motor. It covers manufacturing defects. The warranty is valid in the) Tj T*
(country of purchase. Keep your receipt as proof of the purchase date. Register your) Tj T*
(appliance at nordvik-home.example/register within 60 days to get an extra year of parts) Tj T*
(cover.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Error codes) Tj T*
(F05 - the water does not drain: clean the drain pump filter. F12 - the door lock does) Tj T*
(not engage: close the door firmly and restart. F21 - unbalanced load: spread out the) Tj T*
(laundry.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Service) Tj T*
(Nordvik customer service: +46 8 555 019 40, weekdays 08:00-17:00. Have the model and) Tj T*
(serial number ready; they are on the label inside the door.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
